{"id":"25e593b1b8714c23","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Module Homomorphism","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism — ZFC Algebra2 Module Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism — ZFC Algebra2 Module Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-module]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism — ZFC Algebra2 Module Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,M,N,R\\in V\">\\(f,M,N,R\\in V\\)</span> (map, module carriers, and scalar-ring carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_M,0_M,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M,\\odot_N\\in V\">\\(+_M,0_M,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M,\\odot_N\\in V\\)</span> (module and ring operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (structured left-module predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-theoretic function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_M,0_M,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M,\\odot_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(f(x+_M y)=f(x)+_Nf(y)\\land f(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Nf(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_M,0_M,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M,\\odot_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(f(x+_M y)=f(x)+_Nf(y)\\land f(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Nf(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (structured left-module predicate, see [[58-df-module]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-theoretic function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,M,N,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"+_M,0_M,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M,\\odot_N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}module\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_M,0_M,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M,\\odot_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(N,R,+_N,0_N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;\\forall r\\in R\\;\\bigl(f(x+_M y)=f(x)+_Nf(y)\\land f(r\\odot_Mx)=r\\odot_Nf(x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"10e6ac165c352cd8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1ac0d6c23b975791","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bbbedaecb57ada11","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S$ (module-homomorphism predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"215fb05d088ded8c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S$ (module-homomorphism predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7c0eb208441d0c3e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleHomomorphism}_S(f,U,B,R)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1426","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-homomorphism]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ef3a5dd6825f0373","36d7463d215be751"]}